NC Digital creates professional logos and brand identities for small businesses across South Wales. From Cardiff and Swansea to the Valleys, Newport, and everything in between — we design logos that work across every platform and every format.

> "A strong logo is the foundation of everything else. Get it right and your entire brand becomes more consistent, more credible, and more recognisable."

## Logo design built around your South Wales business

We work with businesses across the region — tradespeople, service businesses, retailers, hospitality companies, professional services firms, and start-ups. Whatever your industry and wherever you're based in South Wales, we create a logo that reflects what you do and who you do it for.

Our logo design projects include:

- **Tradespeople and construction** — logos that project credibility and professionalism
- **Local retailers and hospitality** — identities that stand out on the high street and online
- **Service businesses and consultants** — clean, professional marks that build trust
- **Start-ups and new businesses** — a strong foundation for a brand that will grow

## What's included in our logo design service

Every logo project includes:

- 5 initial logo concepts covering distinct styles and directions
- Revisions until you're 100% happy with the result
- Brand colour palette — primary and secondary colours that work together
- Typography — font pairings that complement your logo and brand personality
- Brand guidelines document for consistent use across all materials
- All file formats: PNG, SVG, PDF, JPEG — ready for web, print, and large-format signage

See our full [logo design service](/services/logo-design/) for complete details.

## No AI. Designed by hand.

Every logo we create is drawn using Adobe Illustrator and Photoshop — no AI-generated artwork, no stock icon libraries, no template shortcuts. Your logo is unique to your business, designed from scratch with your brief in mind.

## Pair it with your website

We design and build websites alongside brand identities, so your logo, colours, and typography are applied consistently from day one. View our [web design service](/services/web-design/) or [browse our portfolio](/portfolio/) to see examples of our work for South Wales businesses.

## Areas we cover

We work with businesses across South Wales and beyond — including [Cardiff](/logo-design-cardiff/), [Swansea](/logo-design-swansea/), [Newport](/logo-design-newport/), [Merthyr Tydfil](/logo-design-merthyr-tydfil/), [Bridgend](/logo-design-bridgend/), [Caerphilly](/logo-design-caerphilly/), [Pontypridd](/logo-design-pontypridd/), [Aberdare](/logo-design-aberdare/), [Llanelli](/logo-design-llanelli/), [Port Talbot](/logo-design-port-talbot/), [Rhondda](/logo-design-rhondda/), [Vale of Glamorgan](/logo-design-vale-of-glamorgan/), [Ebbw Vale](/logo-design-ebbw-vale/), [Penarth](/logo-design-penarth/), [Barry](/logo-design-barry/), [Neath](/logo-design-neath/), [Cwmbran](/logo-design-cwmbran/), [Pontypool](/logo-design-pontypool/), [Maesteg](/logo-design-maesteg/), [Abergavenny](/logo-design-abergavenny/), [Monmouth](/logo-design-monmouth/), [Chepstow](/logo-design-chepstow/), [Porthcawl](/logo-design-porthcawl/), [Blackwood](/logo-design-blackwood/), [Bargoed](/logo-design-bargoed/), [Tredegar](/logo-design-tredegar/), and [Wrexham](/logo-design-wrexham/).

## Frequently asked questions

**How much does logo design cost?**

Contact us for a transparent, fixed-price quote with no hidden extras. Pricing depends on the scope of the project.

**How long does it take?**

Most logo projects are completed within 5–10 working days depending on how quickly feedback is provided.

**Will I own the logo?**

Yes. Full ownership of all files and designs is transferred to you on completion.

**Do you only work in South Wales?**

No — we work with businesses across the UK, though South Wales is our home market and where the majority of our clients are based.

**Can you design my website too?**

Yes. We offer [web design](/services/web-design/) and [web development](/services/web-development/) alongside logo design, so your new identity can be built into a new website from the start.

For businesses outside South Wales, we also cover [logo design across Wales](/logo-design-wales/), [logo design North Wales](/logo-design-north-wales/), and [logo design Mid Wales](/logo-design-mid-wales/).

See all our [web design South Wales services](/web-design-south-wales/).
